Enforce Layout Box Models Over Margins
Pushing elements around using random margin-top or margin-left creates brittle layouts that easily break when content changes. Shift layout responsibility to parent containers using CSS Flexbox or Grid gap properties.
/* Bad: Component controls its own external spacing /
